<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cementos Argos cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cementos Argos cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- ING Barings analysts Hector Castillo and Paula Garcia cut their rating for Colombia's Compania de Cementos Argos SA to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- In an April 30 report, they said in part the company's first quarter earnings per share were 44 percent below their projections.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We are lowering our estimates for 1997 and 1998 to $0.48 and $0.58, respectively, and...changing our price target to $8.20.&quot;</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
